aionui-cowork
=============

This product is a fork of AionUi by iOfficeAI (https://github.com/iOfficeAI/AionUi),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications add a multi-tenant, web-only deployment that executes all agents
and worker processes inside per-session Docker containers, orchestrated by a
control-plane service. See PLAN.md (or docs/dockerize.md) for architecture.

